# basePath Chapter4

::FirstContractOpenCh4 
@trigger    OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene
@once 

{@PAL}      What a fun game of cards! 
{@PAL}      As they say: Work Hard, Play when contractually convenient to your employer!
{@Player}   That's not the saying. 
{@PAL}      Moving on! Captain, I have another suprise for you! 
{@Player}   Another crew-mate, wait... finally someone else on the ship??
{@PAL}      No! 
{@Player}   Oh.
{@PAL}      Instead of one contract, you now have... two!
{@PAL}      Congratulations on achieving agency Captain! 
{@Player}   ...thanks P.A.L. 
{@PAL}      One that is simple, the other contract is a bit more complex. 
{@PAL}      They also have different contractors. One is an independent contract, the other is a Frontier contract. 
{@PAL}      You decide, but remember, Frontier Robotics is your best friend! 


:: BeforeSupplyChainCh4
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene
@once 

{@PAL}      It appears you have a message Captain from the Cu-6529
{@Taryn}    *Automated Message* Hi Locke! 
{@Taryn}    Just a heads up that our Phosphorus production has shut-down for the next few cycles. 
{@Taryn}    We're taking time to celebrate the Kalvis Festival! 
{@Taryn}    All other materials in our sector will be available, but they may take some time. 
{@Taryn}    See you soon, and if you can, you should come planet-side and check the festival out! 
{@Player}   Festival? Is that what Blaze was talking about? 
{@PAL}      